onent check-raises. \n\nSince I'm slightly behind overall (-200 chips cumulative) and this is only hand 3 of 20, I should prioritize not making mistakes over aggressive value extraction. A check guarantees showdown with a likely winning hand, while a bet risks facing a check-raise that puts me in a tough spot.\n\n**Answer:** 0"}
