ng to **Check (0)**. This is a River decision with no bet facing me, and checking costs nothing while allowing me to see a showdown. My two pair (4s and 2s) is a medium-strength hand that could easily win against missed draws, weak pairs, or even ace-high. \n\nGiven the complete lack of aggression from both players through all streets, betting now would likely only fold out worse hands while getting called or raised by better hands. The pot is small, so there's limited value to extract, and checking gives me a free showdown to potentially win with my two pair.\n\n# Answer: 0"}
